Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You all move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a fool to\Nchallenge me, Wheeler now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you'll realize what i knew all along
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you are worthless and you shouldn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,been in my tournament\Nin the first place now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,then go ahead and make your move because
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you've wasted enough of\Nmy time already look i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,finished in the top\Nfour and so did you and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,once i win this duel\Ni'll outrank you My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If only winning were that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.47,0:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I gotta destroy\Nhis blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This card could help, but it's gonna\Ntake a little luck and a lot of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon baby dragon in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey's gonna need our support.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's Yugi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And Teya, they should\Nhave been back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So Merrick's good side does still exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and he was able to confront his\Ndark side by controlling Taya's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But the good Merrick is weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll grow weaker with every passing\Nsecond until the shadows engulf him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Pharaoh, don't allow the\Nevil within my brother to prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can destroy it by\Ndefeating Merrick in your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,next duel and stopping him\Nfrom gaining your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the world will crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if we are victorious\Nagainst Marek's dark side,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll gain all three Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we lose, they're his.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll also get the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving him everything he\Nneeds to absorb your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I shall save the\Nworld from Merrick's evil, Ashizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And save your brother from himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that defeating him will also\Nreverse the damage that's been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I still don't\Nknow how I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember\Nis watching Joey duel Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes is ready\Nto devour you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's Life Points may\Nbe protected right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but none of his monsters\Nare strong enough to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He better think of something and quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to erase what's left of\Nyour life points. With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching your knight into attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wide open now! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Seto's gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:03:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out Joey's knight and\Nthe rest of his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you're way out of your league!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this! Now! Reveal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap card! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm afraid so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Nutrient Z!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It works whenever I'm about to\Nlose 2,000 or more life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives my strength a 4,000 point\Nboost before your attack hits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty swift thinking there, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now you have more\Nlife points than Kaiba does!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what was that you\Nwere saying about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you're an amateur!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Making one decent move\Ndoesn't impress me, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The next turn will be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long shot, but I know I can\Nbeat Kaiba and shut him up for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to draw the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I don't, he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one card can save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it and weep, Kyber!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan will never work. Oh, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see about that, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I still got one more\Nchance to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Time Wizard, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If this works, Kyber's blue eyes\Nwill crumble while my dragon grows!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too risky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey could lose all his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And Seto could lose his blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No skulls, baby, no skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, in your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my time wizard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the calendar is speeding up, causing\Nmy baby dragon to age a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And with age comes experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They grow up so fast, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But there comes a time\Nwhen you gotta let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So goodbye, baby dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, thousand dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess time just wasn't\Non your side, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what a thousand\Nyears does to your dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he thinks he can win the\Nduel with this little stunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.35,0:06:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,he's more of a novice than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.07,0:06:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like time took its\Ntoll on Kaiba's blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the field, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, blue eyes, return to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Blue Eyes is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my interdimensional\Nmatter transporter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,my monster dematerialized just before\Nyour time wizard was able to affect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's back, just in time to tear\Nyour thousand dragon to shreds, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent move, Seto. That's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey had this duel won.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You may depend on luck to win your\Nduels, but I depend on my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the difference between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You really kill me, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just find you ridiculous. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, lighten up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you and I are fighting\Na great duel right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So relax and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:08:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess you're an even more miserable\Nperson than I thought you were, Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I dueled to gain power and to\Nbe the best, not to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Yugi beat me, he\Nstole my glory once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You were good, but Yugi was better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't see why\Nyou can't accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.85,0:08:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect someone\Nlike you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just move on, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll discard my Thunder Dragon in\Norder to activate its special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me draw two\Nmore Thunder Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use Polymerization\Nto fuse them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, meet my twin-headed Thunder Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I play Quick Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows my new monster\Nto attack you immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no chance against my dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still a little freaked\Nout about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I never sleepwalk, especially\Nnot during the day, and for over a mile?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should tell Taya\Nthat Merrick took over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,her mind so he could\Nconfront his evil side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Joey ever finish his\Nduel against Kaiba or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I left while the duel\Nwas still in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hurry, we should\Nget there before it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never let a hack like you defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Twin-headed Thunder Dragon,\Nattack his Thousand Dragon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-eyes White Dragon, attack\Nhim directly and wipe him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, bow down and defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, you did okay, but you're still\Nno match for my brother, right, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Out-dueling Joey Wheeler is\Nno cause for celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have beaten him blindfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Kyber. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, can't you just\Nlet it go? It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not over, Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.05,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's never over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for me, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have beaten me in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And you may even beat me\Nin the next duel, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna keep coming\Nback until I win, Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because Joey\NWheeler doesn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never have the skills\Nto defeat me. Aw, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you some\Nskills, you stuck-up punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget him, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's not worth the effort, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I dueled my best out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I made that rich boy\Nsweat a few times, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come to think of it,\Nwhere's Yugi and Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't stick around\Nto see my big finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to stick\Naround this dump anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's still one more duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.31,0:12:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Ishizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I would advise you to be present for the\Nfinal duel of your tournament, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.59,0:12:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will need your help to defeat\NMerrick and fulfill his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.35,0:12:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City's over for me, and the sooner\NI put this all behind me, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had about all I can take of you people,\Nso leave me alone and have a nice life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking away now is a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is that, Shizu? Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You read about it in one of\Nyour ancient fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your future's at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And deep down, you know\Nthat as well as I do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are able to read\Nthe ancient Egyptian text,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're well aware of\Nwhat is written on the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The sorcerer may have been the pharaoh's\Nrival, but he was also his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The sorcerer is you, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and you must do for Yugi what you\Ndid for the pharaoh 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you, he can't save\Nthe world from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that if you continue\Nto deny your ancient heritage,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire world will suffer\Nbecause of your stubbornness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your rivalry with Yugi has been in\Nexistence for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will continue\Nto exist for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As a skilled sorcerer, you\Nconstantly challenge the pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,strengthening his skills in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was with your help that the\Npharaoh was able to save his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,History is now repeating itself, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I hosted this tournament so I could\Nbecome number one, not to help Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You were destined to\Norganize this event, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and you had no choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You were guided by a\Nforce beyond your control,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you leave now, you'll be\Nturning your back on mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That dual tower stands as a\Nsymbol of my hatred for my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the sight\Nof it, Ishizu. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.31,0:14:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To run away from your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that this is about more\Nthan just you and your family, Kaiba? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I designed this whole tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was robbed of my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still bury my past\Nby destroying that duel tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, prepare for detonation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you, but I don't think destroying\Nthe tower is going to solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All it's gonna do is cause more\Ndestruction, more anger, and more hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think what Yugi said about you is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're filled with hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You battle for all the\Nwrong reasons, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fueled by your anger, your\Nhate, your jealousy, your rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And lastly, the denial of your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll never be a success,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, until you defeat the\Nmonsters inside your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You really kill me, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, you've lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just find you ridiculous. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, lighten up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you and I are fighting\Na great duel right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So relax and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you smile anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know our childhood wasn't the best,\Nbut at least we had fun sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're always in a bad mood,\Nand I want it back the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, they don't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of causing more damage, why don't\Nyou help Yugi win and prevent more damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know the secret to\Ndefeating Marek, then tell Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, how can I help\NYugi win my tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I organized the Battle City\NTournament was so I could defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look who finally decided to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your duel over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea of walking\Nout on me when I needed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey got his butt kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing you missed was seeing\NKaiba make the poor guy squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joey, you lost your duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey did a pretty good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba just did a much\Nbetter job, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.65,0:16:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get him next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,or the time after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, can we just drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all focus on Yu-Gi-Oh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to fight the duel of his\Nlife against that evil freak, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,all three Egyptian god cards will belong\Nto me and the world will cower at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the pharaoh has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll soon learn what\Nsuffering is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,as he joins his friends\Nin the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.21,0:17:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the boundless power of the ancient\Nruler will course through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, you have no idea\Nwho you're messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful out there, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, this nutcase\Nplays by his own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just think of mine having her in\Nthe Shadow Realm is bad enough, but if you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,beat this freak yugi you'll save mine\Nnot to mention the entire world i'll do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,my best that fool thinks having two egyptian\Ngod cards will give him the advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but even slifer and obelisk together\Nare no match for my winged dragon of ra
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Yugi's chances of defeating\NMarek and winning the tournament are slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's too tough, but as Mokuba said,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out the only way to\Nbeat his winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one card, just\None, that can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This all-powerful card lives\Nin my deck and my deck alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not just a matter\Nof holding this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be played in a certain\Nway in order to take down Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top of my duel tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean you're going\Nto help Yugi win, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just stand by and watch\NYugi fall at the hands of Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, I'd\Nenjoy seeing Yugi lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But it might be interesting to see if he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,has what it takes to\Nproperly use this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've made the\Ncorrect decision, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The final duel of the Battle City\NTournament is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.47,0:19:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something you need! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the ultimate test of Yugi's skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If he plays this card correctly, there's\Na slight chance he'll defeat Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,yo, yo
